  patched: /tmp/claude-0/-home-user-playground/925301e5-494b-5a33-b598-8eaa63dd5c1d/scratchpad/work18/G19-dgraph-build-induce/buildfi (same flags, this group's series); ASan trees: INFRA/asan (pristine), /tmp/claude-0/-home-user-playground/925301e5-494b-5a33-b598-8eaa63dd5c1d/scratchpad/work18/G19-dgraph-build-induce/build, build64.
